{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 52, :comments ["And the meaning of <b>and the children of Israel shall encamp</b> is: when the children of Israel encamp." "<b>Each man by his banner.</b> The meaning is each tribe." "And the meaning of <b>each man by his standard</b> is: that the tribe of one banner shall not intermingle with the tribe of another banner."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:55.114468931Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}